WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:03.020
I was hungry.

00:03.140 --> 00:07.120
That tells us. But how hungry was I?

00:07.240 --> 00:13.080
Hyperbole stretches the truth a lot to show how big a feeling is.

00:13.200 --> 00:16.460
I was so hungry I could eat a horse!

00:16.580 --> 00:19.260
Wow, that's really hungry!

00:19.380 --> 00:23.710
Here is one more. My backpack weighs a ton!

00:23.830 --> 00:30.286
So look for something that can't really be true, and try one in your own writing!
